  "changes": [
    "Pixel renderer in the javascript-racer style: road segments projected onto a low-resolution 2D canvas, pre-rendered CC0 sprites, no three.js, GLB or vehicle-data.js",
    "Left-hand-drive first-person cockpit: wheel, dashboard speedometer following the real speed, two A-pillars, two door mirrors and an interior mirror, each mirror a rear projection",
    "Rear traffic of 2/3/4 vehicles by quality that follows, overtakes and respawns behind; all traffic stops at red or yellow stop lines",
    "Scoring, the 10 summary fields, per-round fields, the wrong-way event and its reaction-time rules are unchanged; Space brakes like the brake key",
    "Scooters use their own collision box; asset URLs resolve at module load; touch steering wheel visible; phone status panel, CAM button and desktop map no longer cover mirrors or the speedometer",
    "Includes the 2.0.3 change: controls are preselected from the device"
  ],
